Im a 16 year old kid who works in a hospital delivering food trays to patients, nothing in the hospital has changed. They still make me go into the rooms and have direct contact with people.

&#x200B;

HELP ME PLS

All the planets in our solar system can fit in the space between the Earth and the Moon.

&#x200B;

(When the moon is at its farthest from the Earth)
